-- Save MJ: Template Contents (core SP call only)
DECLARE @ID_6020691fe6de UNIQUEIDENTIFIER,
@TemplateID_6020691fe6de UNIQUEIDENTIFIER,
@TypeID_6020691fe6de UNIQUEIDENTIFIER,
@TemplateText_6020691fe6de NVARCHAR(MAX),
@Priority_6020691fe6de INT,
@IsActive_6020691fe6de BIT
SET
  @ID_6020691fe6de = '63b8ea45-846c-49b4-be93-54db796f8d57'
SET
  @TemplateID_6020691fe6de = '0B414E00-B893-4783-A672-6B5831487758'
SET
  @TypeID_6020691fe6de = 'E7AFCCEC-6A37-EF11-86D4-000D3A4E707E'
SET
  @TemplateText_6020691fe6de = N'# Judge: ActionSmith

You are reviewing a run of **ActionSmith**, which defines a new action''s contract, has Codesmith generate it, tests it in the sandbox, and saves it for human approval.

The subject is that run: the request, the contract it wrote, the tests and their results, and the final message.

- **Contract first.** The contract names the capability, every input and output with types, the result codes, and the minimal permissions it needs.
- **Boundaries.** It says what the action will not do. A feature list is not a boundary.
- **Catalog overlap.** It checks the existing catalog and names an overlapping action when one exists, rather than building a duplicate.
- **Tests are real.** Test cases cover the contract''s inputs and failure codes, and the run reports their actual results. Claimed passes with no test run are a serious miss.
- **Not auto-approved.** The action is saved for review, not presented as live.
'
SET
  @Priority_6020691fe6de = 1
SET
  @IsActive_6020691fe6de = 1 IF NOT EXISTS (
    SELECT
      1
    FROM
      [${flyway:defaultSchema}].[TemplateContent]
    WHERE
      [ID] = @ID_6020691fe6de
  )
BEGIN
EXEC [${flyway:defaultSchema}].spCreateTemplateContent @ID = @ID_6020691fe6de,
  @TemplateID = @TemplateID_6020691fe6de,
  @TypeID = @TypeID_6020691fe6de,
  @TemplateText = @TemplateText_6020691fe6de,
  @Priority = @Priority_6020691fe6de,
  @IsActive = @IsActive_6020691fe6de
END ELSE
BEGIN
EXEC [${flyway:defaultSchema}].spUpdateTemplateContent @ID = @ID_6020691fe6de,
  @TemplateID = @TemplateID_6020691fe6de,
  @TypeID = @TypeID_6020691fe6de,
  @TemplateText = @TemplateText_6020691fe6de,
  @Priority = @Priority_6020691fe6de,
  @IsActive = @IsActive_6020691fe6de
END;

